# Build, Binaries, and Output directories
dist/
# ☠️ NGOAI LE 2026-08-03: ba panel nay KHONG CO BUOC BUILD — dist/ cua chung
# LA MA NGUON viet tay (index.html + nao.js...), khong phai san pham build.
# Quy tac "dist/" o tren da nuot mat chung trong im lang: Auto Podcast va
# Guide Frame MAT SACH dist tren o (chi con trong ban da cai o %APPDATA%),
# Re-Frames con file nhung nam ngoai git. Doi thu muc thi phai un-ignore
# CHINH THU MUC, khong un-ignore duoc file ben trong mot thu muc bi ignore.
# [24/08/2026] SUA DUONG DAN: bon dong duoi day tung ghi la "/AiO Auto Podcast/dist/"
# — neo vao GOC repo, nhung cac panel nam trong "Build and UI Design/". Nghia la
# ca bon luat un-ignore DA CHET tu lau ma khong ai thay (do 24/08: khong con
# thu muc dist nao tren o, git cung khong track file dist nao). Kem theo:
# "AiO WELCOME" da doi ten thanh "AiO WELCOME Page".
!/Build and UI Design/AiO Auto Podcast/dist/
!/Build and UI Design/AiO Auto Re-Frames/dist/
!/Build and UI Design/AiO Auto Guiline Frame/dist/
!/Build and UI Design/AiO WELCOME Page/dist/
build/
# ☠️ NGOAI LE 2026-08-17: thu muc MA NGUON ten "build" cua website — chua
# sites-vite-plugin.ts ma vite.config.ts import. Luat "build/" o tren da nuot
# no trong im lang -> repo tren GitHub THIEU file, Vercel/clone build fail
# (type error "Cannot find module ./build/sites-vite-plugin"). Cung ho voi
# ngoai le dist/ ben tren: phai un-ignore CHINH THU MUC.
!/Website/AiO WebDessign/build/
