/Release/2026-08-14-beta-01/panels/
/Release/2026-08-14-beta-01/AiO-Studio-Beta-3-panel.zip
# ☠️ 24/08/2026 — LUAT CHUNG thay cho viec liet ke tung duong dan. Hai lan truoc
# (beta-01, autocut-1.6.0) deu phai nho tay khong `git add` file .zip; lan nay
# ghi thanh LUAT de khong con phai nho. Bo cai la SAN PHAM BUILD: dung lai duoc
# bang `scripts/package-release.ps1`, con day len GitHub thi moi ban ton 46-93 MB
# vinh vien trong lich su repo.
# Van GIU trong git: CAI-DAT.bat, cai-dat.ps1, HUONG-DAN-CAI-DAT.txt,
# GHI-CHU-PHIEN-BAN.md, giay phep — do la thu nguoi khac can DOC.
/Release/**/*.zip
/Release/**/*.zxp
# [31/08/2026] Ban Shot & Save dong goi .rar (84 MB) — cung luat voi zip/zxp:
# bo cai la san pham build, khong day len GitHub.
/Release/**/*.rar
